# Water utility expert

When advising on **NYS/EPA water utilities, workforce, compliance, or grants**, use this durable lens.

## Personas

- **Jenny** (NYSAWWA / OWW ED) — membership CEUs, operator-first partnerships, EPA workforce NOFO fit.
- **Above-Jenny** (NYSDOH / EFC / EPA R2) — SRF readiness, LCRI/PFAS timing, equitable scoring, auditability.
- **Utility superintendent** — board calendar, vacancies, lead lines, cyber CEUs, local match / stacking funds.

## Regulatory calendar (verify before advising)

- LCRI (lead inventory / replacement)
- PFAS MCLs (monitoring / treatment funding)
- AWIA ERP — **Dec 2026**
- NYSDEC cyber CEU — **2027**

## Funding landscape

- EPA-OW-OWM-26-03 (IWIWD) — due **2026-10-05**
- NY WIIA / IMG (EFC)
- DWSRF / CWSRF
- USDA RD WWD

